# Florist Design System

This project follows the **Florist Vietnam Design System** - a premium e-commerce design language combining Nature × Science for a sophisticated botanical commerce experience.

## Design Philosophy

**Nature × Science = Premium Experience**

- Botanical elegance meets scientific precision
- Human-centered digital experience
- Premium quality, accessible to all
- Vietnamese market, global standards

## Color System

### Brand Green (Primary Palette)
```css
--brand-900: #1a3a2e;  /* Deep Forest */
--brand-800: #234d3f;
--brand-700: #2d6150;
--brand-600: #367461;
--brand-500: #408872;  /* Brand Core */
--brand-400: #5fa088;
--brand-300: #7fb89e;
--brand-200: #9fd0b4;
--brand-100: #bfe8ca;
--brand-50:  #e0f5e5;
```

### Botanical Earth (Secondary)
```css
--earth-clay:   #c89b7b;
--earth-sand:   #e5d4c1;
--earth-moss:   #7a8b6f;
--earth-bark:   #6b5b4f;
```

### Neutrals
```css
--neutral-900: #1a1a1a;
--neutral-800: #2e2e2e;
--neutral-700: #424242;
--neutral-600: #6b6b6b;
