**Usage Rules:**
- Primary buttons, links, active states → `--brand-500`
- Hover states → `--brand-600`
- Disabled states → `--neutral-300`
- Backgrounds → `--neutral-50`, `--neutral-100`
- Text primary → `--neutral-900`
- Text secondary → `--neutral-600`

## Typography

### Font Families
```css
--font-display: 'Playfair Display', serif;
--font-body:    'Inter', sans-serif;
```

### Type Scale
```css
/* Display (Playfair Display) */
--text-hero:      clamp(48px, 8vw, 72px) / 1.1;
--text-h1:        clamp(36px, 6vw, 48px) / 1.2;
--text-h2:        clamp(30px, 5vw, 40px) / 1.25;
--text-h3:        clamp(24px, 4vw, 32px) / 1.3;

/* Body (Inter) */
--text-lead:      20px / 1.6;  /* 500 weight */
--text-body:      16px / 1.6;  /* 400 weight */
--text-small:     14px / 1.5;  /* 400 weight */
--text-caption:   12px / 1.4;  /* 400 weight */
```

**Usage Rules:**
- All headings (`h1`-`h3`) → `--font-display`, `--brand-900`
- Body text, UI labels → `--font-body`
- Hero headlines → `--text-hero`, max 8-10 words per line
- Product names → `--text-body`, `--font-body`, `600` weight
- Prices → `--text-lead`, `--brand-600`, `600` weight
- Descriptions → `--text-body`, `--neutral-600`

## Spacing Scale

```css
--space-1:  4px;
--space-2:  8px;
--space-3:  12px;
--space-4:  16px;
--space-6:  24px;
--space-8:  32px;
--space-12: 48px;
--space-16: 64px;
--space-24: 96px;
--space-32: 128px;
```

**Layout Guidelines:**
- Component padding → `--space-4` to `--space-6`
- Section spacing → `--space-16` to `--space-24`
- Hero spacing → `--space-24` to `--space-32`
- Grid gaps → `--space-6` (mobile), `--space-8` (desktop)

## Border Radius

```css
--radius-sm:   4px;   /* Badges, tags */
--radius-md:   8px;   /* Buttons, inputs */
--radius-lg:   12px;  /* Cards */
--radius-xl:   16px;  /* Modals, large cards */
--radius-pill: 999px; /* Pills, rounded buttons */
```

## Components

### Buttons

**Primary Button**
```css
background: var(--brand-500);
color: white;
padding: 12px 24px;
border-radius: var(--radius-md);
font: 500 16px var(--font-body);
transition: all 0.2s ease;

&:hover {
  background: var(--brand-600);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(64, 136, 114, 0.3);
}

&:disabled {
  background: var(--neutral-300);
  cursor: not-allowed;
}
```

**Secondary Button**
```css
background: transparent;
color: var(--brand-600);
border: 1.5px solid var(--brand-500);
padding: 12px 24px;
border-radius: var(--radius-md);

&:hover {
  background: var(--brand-50);
}
```

**Button Sizes:**
- Small: `padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px;`
- Medium: `padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 16px;` (default)
- Large: `padding: 16px 32px; font-size: 18px;`

### Input Fields

```css
input, textarea, select {
  border: 1.5px solid var(--neutral-300);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 12px 16px;
  font: 400 16px var(--font-body);
  color: var(--neutral-900);
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

input:focus {
  border-color: var(--brand-500);
  outline: none;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(64, 136, 114, 0.1);
}

input::placeholder {
  color: var(--neutral-400);
}

input:disabled {
  background: var(--neutral-100);
  color: var(--neutral-400);
  cursor: not-allowed;
}
```

### Cards

**Product Card**
```css
.product-card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
  border: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
}

.product-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
}

.product-card__image {
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.product-card__content {
  padding: var(--space-4);
}

.product-card__name {
  font: 600 16px var(--font-body);
  color: var(--neutral-900);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
}

.product-card__price {
  font: 600 18px var(--font-body);
  color: var(--brand-600);
}
```

### Badges & Tags

```css
.badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  padding: 4px 12px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  font: 600 12px var(--font-body);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
}

.badge--new       { background: var(--brand-500); color: white; }
.badge--bestseller { background: var(--warning); color: white; }
.badge--limited   { background: var(--error); color: white; }
.badge--preorder  { background: var(--info); color: white; }
```

### Navigation

**Desktop Header**
```css
header {
  background: white;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
  padding: var(--space-4) 0;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

nav a {
  color: var(--neutral-700);
  font: 500 16px var(--font-body);
  transition: color 0.2s ease;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: var(--brand-600);
}

nav a.active {
  color: var(--brand-600);
  position: relative;
}

nav a.active::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -4px;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--brand-500);
}
```

**Mobile Bottom Navigation**
```css
.bottom-nav {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  background: white;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--neutral-200);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  padding: var(--space-2) 0;
  z-index: 100;
}

.bottom-nav__item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-1);
  color: var(--neutral-600);
  font-size: 12px;
}

.bottom-nav__item.active {
  color: var(--brand-600);
}
```

## Photography & Imagery

**Product Images:**
- Clean white or subtle neutral background
- Consistent lighting (soft, natural)
- Aspect ratio: 1:1 (square) for product grids
- High resolution: minimum 800×800px
- Show product details, texture, scale

**Lifestyle Images:**
- Natural settings, warm tones
- Human presence encouraged (hands, spaces)
- Show products in context
- Aspect ratio: 4:3 or 16:9 for banners

**Scientific/Botanical:**
- High detail macro shots
- Educational close-ups of plants
- Clean backgrounds
- Used sparingly for "Plant Passport" features

## Iconography

**Style:**
- Line icons, 2px stroke weight
- Rounded corners (stroke-linecap: round)
- 24×24px base size
- Color: `--neutral-700` (default), `--brand-600` (active)

**Recommended Library:**
- Heroicons (outline variant)
- Lucide Icons
- Or custom SVG following the same style

## Animation & Transitions

```css
/* Micro-interactions */
transition: all 0.2s ease;

/* Hover states */
transform: translateY(-2px);
transition: transform 0.3s ease;

/* Loading states */
@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.5; }
}
```

**Guidelines:**
- Keep transitions subtle (0.2s - 0.3s)
- Use `ease` or `ease-out` easing
- Hover effects: slight lift (`translateY(-2px)`) + shadow
- Loading: pulse or skeleton screens
- Page transitions: fade (0.3s)

## Responsive Breakpoints

```css
--breakpoint-sm: 640px;   /* Mobile landscape */
--breakpoint-md: 768px;   /* Tablet */
--breakpoint-lg: 1024px;  /* Desktop */
--breakpoint-xl: 1280px;  /* Large desktop */
--breakpoint-2xl: 1536px; /* Extra large */
```

**Layout Guidelines:**
- Mobile-first approach
- Product grid: 2 columns (mobile) → 3 (tablet) → 4 (desktop)
- Max container width: 1280px
- Side padding: `--space-4` (mobile), `--space-8` (desktop)

## Accessibility Requirements

- Minimum contrast ratio: 4.5:1 for text
- Focus states: visible `outline` or `box-shadow`
- Interactive elements: minimum 44×44px touch target
- Alt text for all images
- Semantic HTML (`<nav>`, `<main>`, `<article>`, etc.)
- ARIA labels where needed

## Code Implementation Guidelines

### File Naming
```
components/
  ProductCard.jsx
  Button.jsx
  Badge.jsx
  Input.jsx
pages/
  ProductsPage.jsx
  ProductDetailPage.jsx
```

### CSS Variables Usage
```jsx
// ✅ CORRECT
<button style={{ 
  background: 'var(--brand-500)',
  padding: 'var(--space-4) var(--space-6)',
  borderRadius: 'var(--radius-md)'
}} />

// ❌ WRONG
<button style={{ 
  background: '#408872',
  padding: '16px 24px',
  borderRadius: '8px'
}} />
```

### Component Props Pattern
```jsx
// Button sizes
<Button size="sm | md | lg" variant="primary | secondary | tertiary" />

// Badge types
<Badge type="new | bestseller | limited | preorder" />
```

## Anti-Patterns (DO NOT DO)

❌ **Don't use random colors** - only use colors from the defined palette
❌ **Don't use random font sizes** - stick to the type scale
❌ **Don't mix font families** - only Display for headings, Inter for body
❌ **Don't use hard-coded spacing** - use spacing scale variables
❌ **Don't create custom shadows** - use the defined elevation system
❌ **Don't ignore hover states** - all interactive elements need hover feedback
❌ **Don't use low-quality images** - maintain high resolution standards
❌ **Don't ignore mobile** - design mobile-first, enhance for desktop

## Quality Checklist

Before marking any UI component as complete, verify:

- [ ] Colors are from the defined palette (no random hex codes)
- [ ] Typography uses correct fonts and type scale
- [ ] Spacing uses spacing scale variables
- [ ] Border radius matches component type
- [ ] Hover/focus states are implemented
- [ ] Component is responsive (mobile → desktop)
- [ ] Meets accessibility contrast requirements
- [ ] Images have proper aspect ratios
- [ ] Icons follow 2px stroke, rounded style
- [ ] Transitions are smooth (0.2s - 0.3s)
- [ ] Code uses CSS variables, not hard-coded values
- [ ] Component matches the design system exactly

